  "description": "VIVI ACE07 is designed for truly enjoying riding. It has powerful performance, beautiful paint design, eye-catching colors and wide tires, perfectly balancing comfort, efficiency and ease of use. It also offers the benefits of both all-terrain and step-through. ACE07 can adapt to various road conditions, from city streets to gravel roads, whether you are commuting, exercising or enjoying a leisurely weekend ride, VIVI ACE07 provides you with a worry-free riding experience with its unique design.\n\n1500W Peak high speed brushless hub motor, 90Nm\nRemovable 48V 15Ah 720Wh semi-integrated battery\n12 magnet cadence speed sensor\nIntelligent 5 level pedal assist and digital LCD display\nSuspension fork with lockout and adjustment, 100mm travel\nMechanical disc brakes, 180mm rotors\nShimano 7-speed gear system\n54.6V 3Amp smart fast charger\nTop 25Mph and Up to 60 miles of riding range (pedal assist)\n26 × 4.0\" all terrain fat tires\nSGS certified to UL2849 & UL2271 safety standards",
